          <li><strong>Downward swipe collapses</strong>, symmetrically, when expanded.</li>
          <li><strong>Keyboard and AT must still work.</strong> The handle becomes a real <code>&lt;button aria-expanded&gt;</code> named "show navigation". Keyboard activation expands; a pointer tap does not — distinguish with <code>event.detail === 0</code>, not <code>onClick</code> alone, which fires for both.</li>
