            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="phase">
            <div class="phase-n">C</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Fluid keypad and tiles</h3>
              <p>Key size clamps against the panel's own container box, so the keypad fits rather than scrolls.</p>
              <p class="gate"><b>Gate:</b> 4 keypad rows visible without scrolling at 320×568</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="phase">
            <div class="phase-n">D</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Collapse the dock on feature screens</h3>
