          </div>
          <div class="phase">
            <div class="phase-n">E</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Pointer-tracked swipe</h3>
              <p>Shrink the hit area, drop the touch/mouse-move triggers, add the <code>aria-expanded</code> keyboard path.</p>
              <p class="gate"><b>Gate:</b> a tap anywhere on the strip does <b>not</b> expand; a 56 px upward drag does; Enter on the handle does; page scroll near the bottom edge still works</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="phase">
            <div class="phase-n">F</div>
            <div>
              <h3>The two-layer goo morph</h3>
